{"id":"490832","name":"芋艿肉骨汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/490832/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芋艿","amount":"355克"},{"name":"肉骨","amount":"350克"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：芋艿（已去皮洗净）、肉骨（已焯水）、香葱","img":"images/490832/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将肉骨下入高压锅中。","img":"images/490832/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"接着，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/490832/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的清水。","img":"images/490832/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上盖用中小火烧煮20分钟后关火。","img":"images/490832/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"焖至没气后开盖。","img":"images/490832/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，合入芋艿。","img":"images/490832/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再盖上盖烧煮5分钟后关火。","img":"images/490832/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"焖至没气后开盖。","img":"images/490832/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/490832/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加适量的味精。（加不加味精自愿）","img":"images/490832/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"调味翻匀。","img":"images/490832/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盛出装入大碗中，搁入香葱即成。","img":"images/490832/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}